## Conversions

| From | To | Multiply by |
|---|---|---|
| inch | mm | 25.4 |
| mm | inch | 0.03937 |
| mil (0.001") | mm | 0.0254 |
| ft-lb | N·m | 1.356 |
| N·m | ft-lb | 0.7376 |
| in-lb | ft-lb | 0.0833 |
