| Fleetweld 5P / **E6010** | DC+ | 40-70 | 75-130 | 90-175 | 140-225 | 200-275 | 220-325 |
| Fleetweld 5P+ / **E6010** | DC+ | 40-70 | 65-130 | 90-175 | 140-225 | - | - |
